OL,3,GNEWSARare WW1 howitzer trophy gun saved
OL,4,Afrom scrapyard
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was recovered in the 1980s and one
OL,7,Fof its rescuers took it home. He is now
OL,8,Fmoving and was happy to donate it to
OL,9,Fthe museum.
